Right now, it seem to be looking for only two of the conditions specifically and everything else seem to be getting ignored. 

Out of curiosity, I do not see any requirement that the `type` has to be a positive phrase.  So, how would one interpret the arbitrary type string  to decide if this is an error case or not ?
